Third-party components
----------------------

None. Calm room has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on
25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to export the room

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On the three rooms
------------------

The fire, the landscape and the garden are drawn with the canvas API from numbers the engine
computes. The decay curve is exponential and monotonic — the fire never grows on its own, and it
never reaches zero, because a cold hearth is not a punishment. The landscape is deterministic from
its seed, which is what makes it a place rather than a screensaver. The garden has no score, no
count and no completion: raking and placing stones are the whole of it.
